        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Boomershoot, Anvil firing\n- Places: Orofino, Idaho\n- Topics: long range precision rifle events, explosive fireballs, anvil launching\n\nFacts:\n- Boomershoot is a long range precision rifle event held near Orofino, Idaho, each year in late spring.\n- In recent years, Boomershoot has featured an explosive fireball to start the event and entertain participants.\n- In recent years, Boomershoot has also featured an Anvil firing to start the event and entertain participants.\n- In the USA, Anvil firing, also called anvil launching or anvil shooting, is the practice of firing an anvil into the air with gunpowder.",
